INSERT INTO runs VALUES('88628ca9-e8cc-4301-bb84-2ef0a2d9264e','2026-08-10T01:02:01.244715+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Are both Dictyosperma, and Huernia described as a genus?','Yes, both Dictyosperma and Huernia are described as a genus. Dictyosperma is a genus of flowering plants in the family Arecaceae (palms), and Huernia is a genus of flowering plants in the family Apocynaceae. Both are taxonomic genera grouping species that share common characteristics.',1,1877,535,0,10.44200000000000017,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('e3a5d786-d5a6-49fd-9ae1-ecfa5cfb7b81','2026-08-10T01:02:18.967924+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Kaiser Ventures corporation was founded by an American industrialist who became known as the father of modern American shipbuilding?','Yes, Kaiser Ventures corporation was founded by Henry J. Kaiser, an American industrialist who is widely known as the ''father of modern American shipbuilding.'' Kaiser revolutionized shipbuilding through mass-production techniques during World War II, dramatically reducing Liberty ship construction time from over a year to just days. His shipyards, including those in Richmond, California, produced over 1,490 ships during the war. Kaiser Ventures itself emerged from Kaiser Steel, part of Henry J. Kaiser''s broader industrial empire that also included Kaiser Aluminum, Kaiser Cement, and Kaiser Permanente health care.',1,2929,901,1,17.71799999999999998,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('42f09bfe-a20f-4979-a71e-7176f86b66bf','2026-08-10T01:02:31.483857+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'What is the name for the adventure in "Tunnels and Trolls", a game designed by Ken St. Andre?','In Tunnels and Trolls, the adventure (equivalent to a ''dungeon'' or ''module'' in other RPGs like Dungeons & Dragons) is called a ''delve''. This unique terminology was intentionally chosen by designer Ken St. Andre to distinguish his game from D&D when he created it in 1975.',1,1930,609,0,12.50900000000000034,'hotpotqa');
