INSERT INTO runs VALUES('aaceb51c-59a5-4ead-a535-dc5e57f4a774','2026-08-11T05:04:43.294298+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Are both Dictyosperma, and Huernia described as a genus?','Yes, both Dictyosperma and Huernia are described as a genus. Dictyosperma is a genus of flowering plants in the family Arecaceae (palms), containing a single species, Dictyosperma album (the princess palm). Huernia is likewise a genus of flowering plants, belonging to the family Apocynaceae (subfamily Asclepiadoideae), comprising succulent perennial plants native to eastern and southern Africa and Arabia. Both are classified at the genus taxonomic rank, which sits above species and below family in biological classification.',1,1886,606,0,11.13899999999999934,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('1e149c46-56db-4fff-84fc-bebf5af6475a','2026-08-11T05:05:01.010198+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Kaiser Ventures corporation was founded by an American industrialist who became known as the father of modern American shipbuilding?','Yes, Kaiser Ventures corporation was founded by Henry J. Kaiser, an American industrialist who is widely known as the ''father of modern American shipbuilding.'' Kaiser revolutionized U.S. shipbuilding during World War II through mass-production techniques at his Kaiser Shipyards, dramatically reducing Liberty Ship construction time from over a year to just days, and producing over 1,490 ships. Kaiser Ventures itself emerged from his broader industrial empire, which also included Kaiser Steel Corporation, Kaiser Aluminum, and Kaiser Permanente, among many other enterprises.',1,2925,862,1,17.70899999999999964,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('51d5add4-49c8-47c4-9dac-c65e9e34b03c','2026-08-11T05:05:16.860707+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'What is the name for the adventure in "Tunnels and Trolls", a game designed by Ken St. Andre?','In Tunnels and Trolls, the equivalent of what other RPGs (like Dungeons & Dragons) call an ''adventure'' or ''module'' is referred to by specific terms depending on the format: ''solo'' (or ''solo adventure'') for single-player scenarios, and ''dungeon'' for group adventures. The published adventure scenarios in T&T are most distinctively called ''solos,'' which is the term most uniquely associated with the game''s terminology as coined by designer Ken St. Andre.',1,2053,782,0,15.84399999999999942,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('73d73c1c-1bf8-41d0-93ab-c373846e6345','2026-08-11T05:05:28.661143+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'When was Poison''s album "Shut Up, Make Love" released?','There is no recognized Poison album titled ''Shut Up, Make Love.'' This title does not appear in Poison''s documented discography. Poison''s actual studio albums are ''Look What the Cat Dragged In'' (1986), ''Open Up and Say...Ahh!'' (1988), ''Flesh & Blood'' (1990), ''Native Tongue'' (1993), and ''Hollyweird'' (2002). The title may be incorrect, misattributed, or fictitious.',1,1918,611,0,11.79299999999999927,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('4115c8cf-731e-4909-bbfa-89e67a414ce9','2026-08-11T05:05:39.512361+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Hayden is a singer-songwriter from Canada, but where does Buck-Tick hail from?','Buck-Tick hails from Fujioka, Gunma, Japan. They are a Japanese rock band that was formed in 1983.',1,1837,501,0,10.84200000000000052,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('39699208-017b-4bb2-ad9f-96b0401badbd','2026-08-11T05:05:53.337862+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Which  French ace pilot and adventurer fly L''Oiseau Blanc','L''Oiseau Blanc was flown by Charles Nungesser and François Coli. Charles Nungesser was the celebrated French World War I flying ace with 45 aerial victories, renowned for his daring and adventurous spirit. François Coli was his navigator and fellow WWI veteran. Together, they departed from Le Bourget airfield in Paris on May 8, 1927, attempting a transatlantic flight to New York, but tragically disappeared over the Atlantic Ocean — just two weeks before Charles Lindbergh completed his successful crossing.',1,1970,781,0,13.81700000000000017,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('825bd962-ff40-43a1-b225-6e799d0ed088','2026-08-11T05:06:04.294975+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Are Freakonomics and In the Realm of the Hackers both American documentaries?','No, they are not both American documentaries. Freakonomics (2010) is indeed an American documentary film directed by multiple American directors. However, In the Realm of the Hackers (2003) is an Australian documentary film, produced by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation (ABC) and directed by Kevin Anderson, focusing on Australian hackers. Therefore, only Freakonomics qualifies as an American documentary.',1,1906,593,0,10.95100000000000051,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('8310ae48-4aa2-4fa9-9a23-22ff9e2d6f6d','2026-08-11T05:06:14.898390+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Which band, Letters to Cleo or Screaming Trees, had more members?','Letters to Cleo had more members than Screaming Trees. Letters to Cleo had 5 members (Kay Hanley, Greg McKenna, Michael Eisenstein, Scott Riebling, and Tom Polce), while Screaming Trees had 4 members (Mark Lanegan, Gary Lee Conner, Van Conner, and Barrett Martin).',1,1853,546,0,10.59500000000000063,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('d1bc5a1b-0684-491c-a58e-6f3a7a9f3592','2026-08-11T05:06:31.204393+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Alexander Kerensky was defeated and destroyed by the Bolsheviks in the course of a civil war that ended when ?','The premise of the question contains a slight inaccuracy: Alexander Kerensky was not ''destroyed'' in the civil war — he was overthrown during the October Revolution of 1917 and fled into exile. However, the Russian Civil War that followed, in which the Bolsheviks fought against the White Army and other anti-Bolshevik forces, ended in 1922. It concluded formally around October 1922 with the fall of Vladivostok, and led directly to the establishment of the Soviet Union in December 1922.',1,1982,775,0,16.29899999999999949,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('be43d297-fe0a-48ac-8b49-bba59ab9e0ca','2026-08-11T05:06:40.854696+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Seven Brief Lessons on Physics was written by an Italian physicist that has worked in France since what year?','Seven Brief Lessons on Physics was written by Carlo Rovelli, an Italian physicist who has worked in France since 2000, based at the Centre de Physique Théorique in Marseille.',1,1883,547,0,9.64400000000000012,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('816e64a7-fc40-4b25-a05f-18b806ddb68b','2026-08-11T05:06:51.092925+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'The Livesey Hal War Memorial commemorates the fallen of which war, that had over 60 million casualties?','The Livesey Hall War Memorial commemorates the fallen of World War II (the Second World War, 1939–1945), which had over 60 million casualties — in fact, estimates place the total fatalities at approximately 70–85 million, making it the deadliest conflict in human history.',1,1909,512,0,10.2289999999999992,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('a5bdd625-65a3-4a72-a5ee-9ecd0509d29f','2026-08-11T05:07:03.875069+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Are both Elko Regional Airport and Gerald R. Ford International Airport located in Michigan?','No, both airports are not located in Michigan. Gerald R. Ford International Airport is located in Grand Rapids, Michigan, making it the second busiest airport in that state. However, Elko Regional Airport is located in Elko, Nevada, not Michigan. These two airports are in entirely different states.',1,2836,692,1,12.77500000000000035,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('520e3714-8c9d-4319-9f9f-194e5466caa2','2026-08-11T05:07:13.131564+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Ralph Hefferline was a psychology professor at a university that is located in what city?','Ralph Hefferline was a psychology professor at Columbia University, which is located in New York City (specifically in the Morningside Heights neighborhood of Manhattan).',1,1857,529,0,9.25,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('7cfeefca-90f5-4761-b584-2bb4752913b6','2026-08-11T05:07:28.368927+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Which dog''s ancestors include Gordon and Irish Setters: the Manchester Terrier or the Scotch Collie?','The Scotch Collie is the dog whose ancestors include Gordon and Irish Setters. The Scotch Collie''s ancestry is believed to include both the Gordon Setter and the Irish Setter, among other breeds, which contributed to its development as a herding and working dog. The Manchester Terrier, by contrast, was developed primarily from the Black and Tan Terrier crossed with the Whippet, with no Gordon or Irish Setter ancestry.',1,2978,853,1,15.23099999999999988,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('0de255b3-eaa3-4754-a737-b4ebc0acbc0a','2026-08-11T05:07:46.084921+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Where is the company that Sachin Warrier worked for as a software engineer headquartered? ','Google, the company where Sachin Warrier worked as a software engineer, is headquartered in Mountain View, California, USA (at the Googleplex). Google LLC is a subsidiary of Alphabet Inc., and its global headquarters is located in Mountain View, California, United States.',1,3094,1077,1,17.7079999999999984,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('972a54b4-9d35-46ea-9d6a-203c1031c1e6','2026-08-11T05:07:56.960418+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'A Japanese manga series based on a 16 year old high school student Ichitaka Seto, is written and illustrated by someone born in what year?','The Japanese manga series ''I''s'', which is based on the 16-year-old high school student Ichitaka Seto, was written and illustrated by Masakazu Katsura, who was born in 1962 (specifically on December 10, 1962).',1,1932,539,0,10.86599999999999966,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('78c26b07-23c0-4b69-9d37-1d3d59419f06','2026-08-11T05:08:10.353950+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'The battle in which Giuseppe Arimondi lost his life secured what for Ethiopia?','The Battle of Adwa, in which Giuseppe Arimondi lost his life, secured Ethiopia''s independence and sovereignty. It was a decisive Ethiopian victory over Italian colonial forces on March 1, 1896, making Ethiopia the only African nation to successfully repel a European colonial power during the Scramble for Africa. The victory led to Italy formally recognizing Ethiopian independence in the subsequent Treaty of Addis Ababa, and Ethiopia became a powerful symbol of African resistance to European imperialism.',1,1963,725,0,13.38499999999999979,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('02c70eca-5aa3-4ec4-828a-e456648a022e','2026-08-11T05:08:29.601288+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Alfred Balk served as the secretary of the Committee on the Employment of Minority Groups in the News Media under which United States Vice President?','Alfred Balk served as secretary of the Committee on the Employment of Minority Groups in the News Media under Vice President Hubert Humphrey, who was the 38th Vice President of the United States (1965–1969) under President Lyndon B. Johnson. Humphrey was well known for his strong support of civil rights and equal opportunity initiatives during the 1960s.',1,2964,774,1,19.23699999999999832,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('82c394c3-ba14-4079-b555-0503844866c7','2026-08-11T05:08:41.997502+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'A medieval fortress in Dirleton, East Lothian, Scotland borders on the south side of what coastal area?','Dirleton Castle, the medieval fortress located in the village of Dirleton, East Lothian, Scotland, borders on the south side of the Firth of Forth, a large estuary on the east coast of Scotland. The castle grounds are also near the coastal nature reserve of Yellowcraig, which faces the Firth of Forth.',1,2015,698,0,12.38799999999999991,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('3821c443-355b-472a-837b-657274fbb508','2026-08-11T05:08:51.826863+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Who is the writer of this song that was inspired by words on a tombstone and was the first track on the box set Back to Mono?','The song ''To Know Him Is to Love Him'', which was inspired by the words on Phil Spector''s father''s tombstone and was the first track on the box set Back to Mono, was written by Phil Spector.',1,1923,519,0,9.82399999999999985,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('2a6613f8-ce27-40ed-b7f0-6f32eec1f2b2','2026-08-11T05:09:06.952857+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'What type of forum did a former Soviet statesman initiate?','The former Soviet statesman Mikhail Gorbachev initiated the World Political Forum, an international think tank and discussion platform focused on global governance, democracy, and political challenges facing the modern world. He founded it in 2003 after the dissolution of the Soviet Union.',1,1981,725,0,15.11700000000000088,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('bfb2cb15-8116-4405-83f6-5eef3020d67d','2026-08-11T05:09:21.236098+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Are Ferocactus and Silene both types of plant?','Yes, both Ferocactus and Silene are types of plant. Ferocactus is a genus of barrel cacti in the family Cactaceae, classified within the kingdom Plantae as a flowering plant (angiosperm). Silene is likewise a genus of flowering plants in the family Caryophyllaceae, also belonging to the kingdom Plantae. Both families (Cactaceae and Caryophyllaceae) fall within the plant kingdom, confirming that both are indeed plants.',1,1968,789,0,14.27699999999999925,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('aa639a53-52e4-46c0-be50-76ffce49e6c2','2026-08-11T05:09:48.107032+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium_v2','claude-sonnet-4-6',3,'Which British first-generation jet-powered medium bomber was used in the South West Pacific theatre of World War II?','No British first-generation jet-powered medium bomber was actually used in the South West Pacific theatre of World War II. The war ended in August 1945, and jet-powered bombers were still in early development at that time. The English Electric Canberra, Britain''s first jet medium bomber, did not fly until 1949 and entered RAF service in 1951 — well after WWII had concluded. While the Royal Australian Air Force later operated the Canberra in the Pacific region, this was in the post-war era, not during WWII. There is therefore no British jet medium bomber that was used in the South West Pacific theatre during World War II.',1,3515,1625,1,26.86400000000000076,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('8b1c4550-b60a-47d3-9b7e-9b395299058e','2026-08-22T04:48:36.942771+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','gpt-4o-mini',3,replace('Question: What is the FY2018 capital expenditure amount (in USD millions) for 3M? Give a response to the question by relying on the details shown in the cash flow statement.\n\nContext from financial filing:\nTable of Contents \n3M Company and Subsidiaries\nConsolidated Statement of Cash Flow s\nYears ended December 31\n \n(Millions)\n \n2018\n \n2017\n \n2016\n \nCash Flows from Operating Activities\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nNet income including noncontrolling interest\n \n$\n5,363 \n$\n4,869 \n$\n5,058 \nAdjustments to reconcile net income including noncontrolling interest to net cash\nprovided by operating activities\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nDepreciation and amortization\n \n \n1,488 \n \n1,544 \n \n1,474 \nCompany pension and postretirement contributions\n \n \n(370) \n \n(967) \n \n(383) \nCompany pension and postretirement expense\n \n \n410 \n \n334 \n \n250 \nStock-based compensation expense\n \n \n302 \n \n324 \n \n298 \nGain on sale of businesses\n \n \n(545) \n \n(586) \n \n(111) \nDeferred income taxes\n \n \n(57) \n \n107 \n \n 7 \nChanges in assets and liabilities\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nAccounts receivable\n \n \n(305) \n \n(245) \n \n(313) \nInventories\n \n \n(509) \n \n(387) \n \n57 \nAccounts payable\n \n \n408 \n \n24 \n \n148 \nAccrued income taxes (current and long-term)\n \n \n134 \n \n967 \n \n101 \nOther net\n \n \n120 \n \n256 \n \n76 \nNet cash provided by (used in) operating activities\n \n \n6,439 \n \n6,240 \n \n6,662 \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nCash Flows from Investing Activities\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nPurchases of property, plant and equipment (PP&E)\n \n \n(1,577) \n \n(1,373) \n \n(1,420) \nProceeds from sale of PP&E and other assets\n \n \n262 \n \n49 \n \n58 \nAcquisitions, net of cash acquired\n \n \n13 \n \n(2,023) \n \n(16) \nPurchases of marketable securities and investment