INSERT INTO runs VALUES('ed038226-efca-4608-9165-19da0efdc750','2026-08-23T00:56:33.554119+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Hayden is a singer-songwriter from Canada, but where does Buck-Tick hail from?','Buck-Tick hails from Japan—specifically Fujioka, Gunma Prefecture. The band, formed in 1983, is one of Japan''s influential rock and visual kei bands, in contrast to Hayden, who is a singer-songwriter from Canada.',1,2363,589,0,9.97600000000000087,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('b70f67ba-9dcf-4099-91cb-24fd30a43ae1','2026-08-23T00:56:42.712937+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Which  French ace pilot and adventurer fly L''Oiseau Blanc','Charles Nungesser, a French flying ace and adventurer from World War I, piloted L''Oiseau Blanc. He was accompanied by navigator François Coli on the attempted first non-stop transatlantic flight from Paris to New York in May 1927.',1,2403,649,0,9.150999999999999802,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('1952117a-605e-4076-b17a-fed5a728df92','2026-08-23T00:56:50.844322+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Are Freakonomics and In the Realm of the Hackers both American documentaries?','No. While Freakonomics is a 2010 American documentary film, In the Realm of the Hackers is a 2003 Australian documentary produced in Australia, not the United States. Therefore they are not both American documentaries.',1,2336,561,0,8.125,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('821ffa1c-82d3-45fd-8189-782725519c6a','2026-08-23T00:57:01.682900+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Which band, Letters to Cleo or Screaming Trees, had more members?','Letters to Cleo had more members. The band''s classic lineup consisted of five official members (Kay Hanley, Greg McKenna, Michael Eisenstein, Stacy Jones, and Scott Riebling), while Screaming Trees maintained a four-piece lineup throughout its existence.',1,2410,686,0,10.83500000000000086,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('d4b36f77-9f85-4140-988e-f21ce16ef9bf','2026-08-23T00:57:11.204182+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Alexander Kerensky was defeated and destroyed by the Bolsheviks in the course of a civil war that ended when ?','The Russian Civil War, in which Alexander Kerensky and anti-Bolshevik forces were defeated by the Bolsheviks, ended in 1922 with a Bolshevik victory, leading to the formation of the Soviet Union.',1,2481,720,0,9.51600000000000001,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('f53215e9-3f2c-4db1-9d92-9ed77acd582e','2026-08-23T00:57:20.217809+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Seven Brief Lessons on Physics was written by an Italian physicist that has worked in France since what year?','Seven Brief Lessons on Physics was written by Italian physicist Carlo Rovelli, who has worked in France since 2000 at the Centre de Physique Théorique in Marseille (Aix-Marseille University).',1,2420,638,0,9.009000000000000341,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('12ed7e7f-85c7-4f27-8bad-6a72ed7ebd37','2026-08-23T00:57:28.212064+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'The Livesey Hal War Memorial commemorates the fallen of which war, that had over 60 million casualties?','The Livesey Hall War Memorial commemorates the fallen of World War II (1939-1945), the deadliest conflict in human history, which resulted in an estimated 60 to 85 million total casualties.',1,2333,505,0,7.990000000000000213,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('83d716bd-a8ab-4e9f-b230-3922a390f953','2026-08-23T00:57:36.899473+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Are both Elko Regional Airport and Gerald R. Ford International Airport located in Michigan?','No. Elko Regional Airport is located in Elko, Nevada, while Gerald R. Ford International Airport is located in Grand Rapids, Michigan. Only the latter is in Michigan.',1,2393,640,0,8.68299999999999983,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('b39dee9e-0b01-4e11-b1b7-497cd9b2e129','2026-08-23T00:57:45.628883+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Ralph Hefferline was a psychology professor at a university that is located in what city?','Ralph Hefferline was a psychology professor at Columbia University, which is located in New York City (specifically in the Morningside Heights neighborhood of Manhattan).',1,2357,601,0,8.724000000000000198,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('6955f589-a18a-46c1-b1cc-f3b3822f5f6a','2026-08-23T00:57:55.518933+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Which dog''s ancestors include Gordon and Irish Setters: the Manchester Terrier or the Scotch Collie?','The Scotch Collie is the breed whose ancestors include the Gordon and Irish Setters. Its landrace development involved crossing with setters such as the Gordon Setter and Irish Setter, whereas the Manchester Terrier descends from the Black and Tan Terrier and the Whippet, not from setters.',1,2469,715,0,9.88499999999999979,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('4c560e8a-fba5-468f-b4a1-2e1cf9c98877','2026-08-23T00:58:03.351987+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Where is the company that Sachin Warrier worked for as a software engineer headquartered? ','Sachin Warrier worked as a software engineer at Tata Consultancy Services (TCS), which is headquartered in Mumbai, Maharashtra, India.',1,2347,569,0,7.828000000000000291,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('a835b974-e45d-42f2-a52d-5a6e03d96c26','2026-08-23T00:58:12.751791+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'A Japanese manga series based on a 16 year old high school student Ichitaka Seto, is written and illustrated by someone born in what year?','The manga series I"s, which features 16-year-old high school student Ichitaka Seto, was written and illustrated by Masakazu Katsura, who was born in 1962 (on December 10, 1962).',1,2441,640,0,9.3960000000000008,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('329b7b17-07fd-4fe6-a1e6-8d7f500cde79','2026-08-23T00:58:24.738217+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'The battle in which Giuseppe Arimondi lost his life secured what for Ethiopia?','Giuseppe Arimondi died at the Battle of Adwa in 1896, a decisive Ethiopian victory over Italy. This battle secured Ethiopia''s independence and sovereignty, preventing Italian colonization and making Ethiopia one of the few African states to resist European colonization.',1,2442,701,0,11.98199999999999932,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('bfc4f4cd-4a8f-4e69-9b3f-60227c9eb514','2026-08-23T00:58:34.155487+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Alfred Balk served as the secretary of the Committee on the Employment of Minority Groups in the News Media under which United States Vice President?','Alfred Balk served as secretary of the Committee on the Employment of Minority Groups in the News Media under United States Vice President Nelson Rockefeller.',1,2491,693,0,9.41300000000000025,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('bce061e7-53ab-402c-a301-61b744bd0d8b','2026-08-23T00:58:43.372397+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'A medieval fortress in Dirleton, East Lothian, Scotland borders on the south side of what coastal area?','Dirleton Castle, a medieval fortress in the village of Dirleton, East Lothian, Scotland, borders on the south side of the Firth of Forth.',1,2462,684,0,9.211999999999999745,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('22e149ef-27d4-4753-ad44-2ac5803c1f8b','2026-08-23T00:58:52.893797+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Who is the writer of this song that was inspired by words on a tombstone and was the first track on the box set Back to Mono?','Phil Spector wrote the song ''To Know Him Is to Love Him,'' which was inspired by the epitaph on his father''s tombstone (''To Know Him Was to Love Him'') and was the first track on the Back to Mono box set.',1,2437,642,0,9.51600000000000001,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('614c4c44-08af-43d4-b597-119bfb1a5eb6','2026-08-23T00:59:01.598652+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'What type of forum did a former Soviet statesman initiate?','Mikhail Gorbachev, a former Soviet statesman, initiated the World Political Forum, an international think tank (political forum) founded in 2003 to bring together political leaders and scholars to discuss global political challenges.',1,2330,587,0,8.701000000000000511,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('3f48598e-102d-481a-89cf-52a344706182','2026-08-23T00:59:10.609399+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Are Ferocactus and Silene both types of plant?','Yes, both Ferocactus and Silene are types of plant. Ferocactus is a genus of flowering plants in the family Cactaceae, while Silene is a genus of flowering plants in the family Caryophyllaceae. Both families are classified within the kingdom Plantae.',1,2369,653,0,9.006999999999999674,'hotpotqa');
INSERT INTO runs VALUES('ba6155b1-01bb-436b-be93-9dd1b7af9319','2026-08-23T00:59:23.000945+00:00','strict_repair','sequential_3node','medium','claude-opus-4-8',3,'Which British first-generation jet-powered medium bomber was used in the South West Pacific theatre of World War II?','No such aircraft existed. Britain''s first-generation jet-powered medium bomber, the English Electric Canberra, did not enter service until 1951, well after World War II ended in 1945. No British jet-powered medium bomber served in the South West Pacific theatre or any other WWII theatre; the only British jet of the war was the Gloster Meteor fighter.',1,2531,829,0,12.38700000000000045,'hotpotqa');
