of shares outstanding\n \n \n \n \nBasic\n767\n \n762 \n754\nDiluted\n771\n \n771 \n766\nThe accompanying notes are an integral part of these Consolidated Financial Statements.\nF-5','\n',char(10)),'The FY2017-FY2019 3-year average capex as a percentage of revenue cannot be calculated from the provided documents. The consolidated statements of operations show revenues of $7,017M (FY2017), $7,500M (FY2018), and $6,489M (FY2019), but capital expenditures data from the cash flow statement is required and not provided in the excerpt.',1,16903,2765,6,18.40899999999999892,'financebench');
