:1 if his multi-instrument use in recordings is counted, but Wolf Alice''s 4-member band each plays one instrument. The comparison is close and context-dependent."\n}','\n',char(10)),648,594,0,'length_bound','["length_bound"]','[{"category": "length_bound", "loc": "coverage_notes", "type": "string_too_long", "msg": "String should have at most 250 characters"}]','claude-sonnet-4-6');
