nimated series. The most likely intended answer is that the singer also voiced Sonic the Hedgehog.", "supporting_entity_ids":["a_rather_blustery_day","hedgehog_character"], "confidence":0.35, "confidence_bucket":"low"}','\n',char(10)),750,551,0,'parse_error','["parse_error"]','[{"category": "parse_error", "loc": "", "type": "json_invalid", "msg": "Invalid JSON: expected ident at line 1 column 2"}]','claude-sonnet-4-6');
