INSERT INTO node_attempts VALUES(3050,'b580d948-5ba7-42f2-b59e-9fd25a5f48d9','gather',0,replace('```json\n{\n  "facts": [\n    {\n      "entity_id": "quick_ratio",\n      "fact": "The quick ratio is calculated as (current assets minus inventory) divided by current liabilities, measuring a company''s ability to meet short-term obligations with its most liquid assets excluding inventory.",\n      "relevance": 0.95\n    },\n    {\n      "entity_id": "three_m_company",\n      "fact": "3M Company''s quick assets for Q2 FY2023 (June 30, 2023) totaled approximately $9,895 million, calculated from cash and equivalents ($4,258M), marketable securities ($56M), and accounts receivable ($4,947M), excluding inventory.",\n      "relevance": 0.98\n    },\n    {\n      "entity_id": "three_m_company",\n      "fact": "3M Company''s current liabilities as of June 30, 2023 were $10,936 million, resulting in a quick ratio of approximately 0.90, indicating the company has $0.90 in liquid assets for every $1.00 of current liabilities.",\n      "relevance": 0.98\n    },\n    {\n      "entity_id": "liquidity_profile",\n      "fact": "A quick ratio below 1.0 suggests potential liquidity constraints, as the company cannot cover all current liabilities with its most liquid assets alone, though ratios between 0.8 and 1.0 are often considered acceptable depending on industry and business model.",\n      "relevance": 0.92\n    },\n    {\n      "entity_id": "three_m_company",\n      "fact": "3M Company''s short-term borrowings and current portion of long-term debt increased significantly from $1,938 million in December 2022 to $3,033 million in June 2023, representing a 56% increase that pressures the quick ratio.",\n      "relevance": 0.90\n    },\n    {\n      "entity_id": "quick_ratio",\n      "fact": "The quick ratio is highly relevant for assessing liquidity as it excludes inventory, which may not be quickly convertible to cash, providing a more conservative measure of short-term financial health than the current ratio.",\n      "relevance": 0.93\n    }\n  ],\n  "fact_count": 6,\n  "coverage_notes": "Facts establish 3M''s Q2 FY2023 quick ratio of 0.90, which is below the ideal 1.0 threshold but within acceptable ranges for many industries. The quick ratio is confirmed as relevant for liquidity assessment. The significant increase in short-term debt is noted as a concerning factor affecting liquidity profile."\n}\n```','\n',char(10)),1153,643,0,'markdown_wrap','["markdown_wrap"]','[{"category": "markdown_wrap", "loc": "", "type": "json_invalid", "msg": "Invalid JSON: expected value at line 1 column 1"}]','claude-haiku-4-5-20251001');
