e from 36.8% to 34.6% is contextualized within the broader positive two-year trend."\n}\n```','\n',char(10)),1022,576,0,'markdown_wrap','["markdown_wrap"]','[{"category": "markdown_wrap", "loc": "", "type": "json_invalid", "msg": "Invalid JSON: expected value at line 1 column 1"}]','claude-haiku-4-5-20251001');
